  "description" : "This dataset includes the number of children who are on EEC's centralized waitlist for Child Care Financial Assistance (CCFA). Families may be added to the waitlist by any Family Access Administrator which includes, but is not limited to, Child Care Resource and Referral Agency (CCR&R), Contracted Child Care Provider, or Mass 211. The data is both longitudinal and disaggregated by Subsidy Region.\n\nThis dataset is part of <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiZmNlNjUwMmEtYzM1NC00OGU2LWIyYWQtMzg1MDk2MmE3MDJkIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9&pageName=9949865fcf248b434d7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EEC's Key Performance Indicator (KPI) Dashboard</a>.",
